title: "Preview and apply a package change"
---
stateDiagram-v2
  s0: Ready
  s1: Preview shown
  s2: Cancelled
  s3: Preview only
  s4: Confirmed
  s5: Change applied
  s6: Inputs changed#59; preview again
  [*] --> s0
  s0 --> s1: inspect the selected installation
  s1 --> s2: decline or close input
  s1 --> s3: use --dry-run
  s1 --> s4: confirm or pass --yes
  s4 --> s5: apply [inputs still match]
  s4 --> s6: refuse [inputs changed]
